Examples of concrete success and failures of AI
  Self - driving car
    AI Can take picutures of what is in front of the car and collect data from other inputs 
    such as speed and radar and figure out the posisions of the other cars around your car. 
        Input A: Picture, sensor, radar
        Input B: Position of other cars
    AI cannot look at a picture of a person (construction worker) and figure out what that 
    person is trying to convey to you. 
      (consruction worker gesturing for driver to slow or stop) 
      (hitchhiker raising hand asking to be picked up) 
      (bicyclist putting their arm our signalling their left turn)
    AI systems needs to be accurate and trustworthy

  X-Ray Analysis and Diagnosis
    AI can diagnose pneumonia by studying 10,000+ label x-ray images 
    AI cannot diagnose pneumonia from 10 images of a medical textbook chapter explaining 
    pneumonia
      AI will not be able to figure out what is A (X-rays of pneumonia) and what is B 
      (pnuemonia diagnosis) by just analyzing a medical textbook about pneumonia.

ML tends to work well when: 
  1. Learning a "simple" concept
  2. There is lots of data available
ML tends to work poorly when: 
  1. Learning complex concepts from small amounts of daa
  2. It is asked to perform on new types of data that is different than the data it has 
     seen in the original data set. 
       AI can diognose pneumonia from x-ray pictures based on a data set of high-quality         x-rays of patients with pneumonia. 
           However, if this AI system is used to analyze poor-quality x-rays then it will 
           have a hard time producing a diagnosis. 
